          <span class="vs-ticker-text">BUY MULTI-PACK COMBOS &amp; SAVE UP TO 30%</span>
        </span>
        <span class="vs-ticker-dot" aria-hidden="true">•</span>

        <!-- Item 4: MECO Clamp Meter -->
        <span class="vs-ticker-item">
          <svg class="vs-ticker-svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 2v11h3v9l7-12h-4l4-8z"/></svg>
          <span class="vs-ticker-text">INDIA'S BEST MECO CLAMP METER</span>
        </span>
        <span class="vs-ticker-dot" aria-hidden="true">•</span>

        <!-- Item 5: Electric Saver Card -->
        <span class="vs-ticker-item">
